# ============================================================================
# ArcAQ Governance Instance Data — Sovereign Knowledge Graph
#
# This file contains the OPERATIONAL governance facts:
#   • Data processing rules (règles de traitement)
#   • Regulations (GDPR, Banking, ISO27001, Public Sector)
#   • Compliance rules per jurisdiction
#   • Data domains (finance, RH, santé, stratégique, citoyen)
#   • Jurisdictions
#   • Processing purposes
#
# Loaded into Jena Fuseki at startup via load_ontologies.py or seed_jena.py.
# Named graph: http://arcaq.com/ontology/arcaq-governance-data
# ============================================================================

# ============================================================================
# JURISDICTIONS
# ============================================================================

arcaq:Jurisdiction_FR
